/// The Aviary from start to goal (any%), human-possible, in 1370 ticks.
/// Every stretch of buttons is held 3 ticks or more, and jump is pressed only after it was let
/// go. Of its 188 changes of buttons, each moved 1 or 2 ticks early or late, 181 live
/// through the second after, 174 through two seconds, and 147 through the whole
/// run with every later button as it was. Human-possible means each input has slack and a slip
/// is recoverable within a second, not that a person was tested on it.
pub const HUMAN_ANY: [Hold; 189] = [
    hold(RIGHT | JUMP | PRESS, 12),
    hold(RIGHT | UP | JUMP, 12),
    hold(JUMP, 18),
    hold(RIGHT | UP | JUMP, 6),
    hold(RIGHT | UP, 6),
    hold(RIGHT | JUMP | PRESS, 6),
    hold(RIGHT | UP, 6),
